# VS Code Keyboard Shortcuts — Windows

## General

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Ctrl + Shift + P` | Command Palette |
| `Ctrl + P` | Quick Open (go to file) |
| `Ctrl + Shift + N` | New Window |
| `Ctrl + W` | Close Window/Tab |
| `Ctrl + ,` | Open Settings |
| `Ctrl + K Ctrl + S` | Open Keyboard Shortcuts |

## Basic Editing

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Ctrl + X` | Cut line (empty selection) |
| `Ctrl + C` | Copy line (empty selection) |
| `Ctrl + Shift + K` | Delete line |
| `Ctrl + Enter` | Insert line below |
| `Ctrl + Shift + Enter` | Insert line above |
| `Alt + Up / Down` | Move line up/down |
| `Shift + Alt + Up / Down` | Copy line up/down |
| `Ctrl + /` | Toggle line comment |
| `Shift + Alt + A` | Toggle block comment |

## Navigation

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Ctrl + G` | Go to line |
| `Ctrl + Tab` | Switch between open files |
| `Ctrl + B` | Toggle Sidebar |
| `Ctrl + `` | Toggle Terminal |
| `Ctrl + Shift + E` | Show Explorer |
| `Ctrl + Shift + F` | Show Search |
| `Ctrl + Shift + G` | Show Source Control |
| `Ctrl + Shift + D` | Show Run & Debug |
| `Ctrl + Shift + X` | Show Extensions |

## Search & Replace

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Ctrl + F` | Find |
| `Ctrl + H` | Replace |
| `Ctrl + Shift + H` | Replace in files |
| `F3 / Shift + F3` | Find next/previous |
| `Alt + Enter` | Select all occurrences of Find match |

## Multi-Cursor & Selection

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Alt + Click` | Insert cursor |
| `Ctrl + Alt + Up / Down` | Insert cursor above/below |
| `Ctrl + D` | Add selection to next Find match |
| `Ctrl + Shift + L` | Select all occurrences of current selection |
| `Ctrl + U` | Undo last cursor operation |

## Debugging

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `F9` | Toggle breakpoint |
| `F5` | Start/Continue debugging |
| `F10` | Step over |
| `F11` | Step into |
| `Shift + F11` | Step out |
| `Shift + F5` | Stop debugging |

## Terminal

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `` Ctrl + ` `` | Toggle Integrated Terminal |
| `Ctrl + Shift + `` | Create New Terminal |
| `Ctrl + C` | Copy (in terminal) |
| `Ctrl + V` | Paste (in terminal) |

## Formatting

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Shift + Alt + F` | Format document |
| `Ctrl + K Ctrl + F` | Format selection |

---

**Pro Tip:** You can customize or search for any shortcut by pressing `Ctrl + K Ctrl + S`.
